WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:02.600
It will become the Gate of Massacre!

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.060
<i>KAGEYAMA!!!</i>

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:05.730
Too slow!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.040
<i>Thank you, Ukiya. Thanks to you,
I had a pleasant school life.</i>

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.280
Rurippe...

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.710
I'm...

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.780
...just like he said.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:26.410
I'm just a maggot!

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.260
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.850
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.400
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.400
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.800
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.360
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.980
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:11.450
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:14.110
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:18.820
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.090
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:25.460
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:29.230
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.370
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:36.310
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.110
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.350
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:45.650
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:52.180
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:09.900
Assemble. Assemble.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:14.710
Assemble. Assemble!
We have our orders!

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:23.140
We are coming to our master!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.300
Let's go, my faithful servants!

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.410
Rurippe...!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.750
Are you finally awake?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.250
Where am I?

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:29.550
You were so worn out,
you fell down, Captain!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:34.220
Kaoru carried you inside
along with the entire robot.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.260
I'm glad you're okay.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.570
Oh, yeah... I have to go!

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:52.910
What?

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.240
What did you say?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.280
I have to...!

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:01.950
...even without the robot!

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:02.950
You can't!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.550
This entire area is
crawling with invaders!

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.720
Then we'll request backup!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.560
We can't!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:12.290
According to the undercover
squad member report...

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.730
...the Far Eastern branch has already
been taken over by invaders!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.230
What?!

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.760
I also want to go rescue
Princess Ruriko, but we can't right now.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.300
I have to go regardless!

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:30.940
I won't let you go!
Even if I have to stop you by force!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.320
Yeah! The only way you're going
is over my dead body!

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:36.250
Kaoru, please move!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.580
LlNER THROW!!

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.060
O- Over my dead body...

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:50.190
You want to defeat Kageyama...
You want to save Ruriko...

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:55.170
You can't do both things at once!
You're in no condition to, Ukiya!

00:04:57.010 --> 00:05:01.270
Please think about it more calmly.
Now that the commander has been captured...

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:06.180
...the only one we can count on is you,
our captain, Ukiya!

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.980
Captain...

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.180
That's right, Captain Ukiya.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.150
If you care about lkusawa,
don't do anything rash.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.030
It's the enemy!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.110
They're gaining!

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:41.780
Explosive Panda...

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.190
...FlRE BALL!!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.790
GATE OPEN!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.010
This bus can't take much more!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.140
So we can't keep running away forever.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:20.680
If we can find somewhere... somewhere
we can hide and repair the gate robot...

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.990
Don't be silly.
Such an ideal location...

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:24.650
I know one!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.290
...definitely exists!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.670
I know one place we can use.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.700
It should do...

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.150
NEW YORK GENERAL HQ

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.690
NEW YORK GENERAL HQ
Japan has been captured by invaders, sir.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:52.660
NEW YORK GENERAL HQ

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:01.500
Why can't we go to their aid?!  With my Gate of Speed,
we can go to Japan in a flash!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:06.600
There is no need. The US forces in Japan
have already been recalled to America, as well.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:10.370
Do you intend to forsake Japan, sir?!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:12.100
What choice is there?

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:16.880
One Orient island country is
a small price to pay for world peace.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.440
General Commander!

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.480
The decision has been made!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:38.560
Isn't Mr. Kageyama incredible?! He even got
those scary looking people to agree with him.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.660
That's our chairman for you!

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.500
Oh, here they come.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:47.630
Uh... We're from WHK TV.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.880
I've been expecting you.
So, how long will it take to set up?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.380
Well, sir... we should be
ready by tomorrow evening.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.420
That's too slow.
S- Sir!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.820
You have until morning.

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:01.690
Yes, sir. We shall try
our best. Excuse me.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:28.680
How goes it, Megane?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:32.450
I've effected emergency repairs
on every section, but the engine...?

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.390
Can't you do anything?!

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:36.430
I'm doing my best!!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.030
There are all sorts of tools in here.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.190
That's true!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:49.800
This was your father's workplace,
wasn't it?

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:53.040
It wasn't work.
It was just a hobby.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:14.890
<i>You said you were gomg to fix it.
Your're a big liar!</i>

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:18.300
A liar, huh?

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.800
Hey, wait! Oops!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:24.810
I believe... I may...
have lost... my balance!

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:32.250
Are you all right?

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:37.750
What is it?

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.930
This! This is a gate engine!!

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:44.090
What?!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:58.280
You have to be kidding.
What's a gate engine doing in Dad's car?

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.370
I'm positive of it!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:04.570
This is a genuine prototype gate engine.
The first gate engine ever made!

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.210
That means that Mr. Gate Robot...

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:08.650
...can be fixed!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.690
The engine block is still working,
so l should be able to!

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.250
I don't understand.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:17.520
We got lucky, Ukiya!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.030
Ukiya ?!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.600
<i>Why is there gate engine
in Dad's car?!</i>

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:32.300
<i>that big liar's car? Why?!</i>

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.000
<i>I don? understand!</i>

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.630
While you're here,
would you like to eat supper?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.670
I've sent Saemi out to buy groceries,
so once she gets back, I can...

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.710
Mom!

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:09.910
Please tell me... about Dad.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.340
I want to know about the guy who made life
hard for you, who promised to come...

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:20.290
...to my graduation ceremony, but instead
performed an engine test on his car...

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.920
...and died like a selfish bastard.
I want to know about him.

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:32.760
I already told you.
You misjudged your father.

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:46.050
Look.

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.810
9240...?

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:53.580
That's right.
He was on the way to your graduation.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.620
But the engine test...

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.730
He had completed the engine.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.490
What?

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:08.000
He had found a place to lend him the money...

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.640
...and on the way back
from the place...

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:19.470
It's gotten late.
Today, I'm definitely going to keep my word.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:27.620
Your father tried his
utmost to keep his word.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:45.630
<i>Can it be that Dad
also had gate ability?</i>

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:18.100
Why... didn't you tell me sooner?

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.710
What are you talking about?
You never bothered to listen before.

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:25.810
Mom...

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.780
What, dear?

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:34.790
I... I mean, we... desperately
need to use Dad's engine.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:37.260
Heck, why not!
Go ahead and use it.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.850
But...

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.950
I'm sure it would make
your father very happy.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.840
Wouldn't it, dear?

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:57.510
All right, Mom.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.710
Thank you!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.620
Kaoru...

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:35.380
I'm home. Mom, did
big brother come home just now?

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:37.580
Oh, he always does!

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:38.820
Huh?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.880
This is his home after all.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:08.880
<i>She doesn't have a
runny nose like you.</i>

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:18.190
<i>I'm not runny nosed brat!
I'll try even harder...</i>

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.200
<i>...and someday I'll become
such a fine young woman...</i>

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:28.310
...I'll surprise Ukiya!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:33.970
FUKUSHIWA IKUSAWA

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:38.010
<i>But... But!</i>

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.020
<i>No, its okay.</i>

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:46.750
<i>I know you can do it!</i>

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:51.580
<i>Someday I'll bring out
my true ability”!</i>

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.720
What is this?!

00:15:57.630 --> 00:16:02.200
Is this the girl who is
smart, wealthy, and pretty?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.970
Is this Ruriko lkusawa?

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:07.270
This can't be her.
lt's just like me...

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:11.010
This can't be!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.990
Now, show me. Show me
your true, ugly self.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:18.650
<i>Someday, I'm sure...!</i>

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:21.050
Give up. You're not good enough.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.490
<i>Who said that?</i>

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:28.090
Look around you. Nobody is trying
to acknowledge your ability.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.630
<i>That's why I vowed to try harder...!</i>

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.960
Yes, that's right. Hate them.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.230
<i>What?</i>

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:38.260
Hate the people who place no value on you.
Hate them more and more!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.780
But...

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.140
up-

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.150
Isn't that great, Ukiya?

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:53.590
No, we still don't know whether
Dad's engine will work or not!

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:58.160
Say...

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.890
Huh?

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:04.400
Ukiya...? How do you feel...

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.440
...about lkusawa?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.800
What?

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:13.340
What's this?

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:15.840
She is crying.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.840
A small girl is crying.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.990
Rurippe! Megumi!

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:36.730
Hate the people who didn't acknowledge
you. Hate them more and more!

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.270
No... I can't.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.230
Why not?

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:42.640
Because I am a runny-nosed brat.

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:47.340
Then hate Shun Ukiya.
He called you a runny-nosed brat.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.010
What's wrong?

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:54.020
But I...

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:57.510
Rurippe... Rurippe!!

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.360
Rurippe...

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:07.620
Yukino, you helped us like this
during yesterday's battle, too.

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:10.170
Why are you always looking over us?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.790
I shall wait forever.
Even for so long this flowing black hair...

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:18.170
...should become stained with white,
I shall wait forever, with love for you.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:26.350
Because you two are the reflection of us.
I do not wish you to repeat our folly.

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.120
That's all...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:33.680
Ukiya...

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.350
Kaoru.
Yes?

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:38.400
Let's go!
We'll help to fix the gate robot!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.920
Understood!

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:58.110
<i>An emergency broadcast from
the government will now begin.</i>

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:05.920
<i>Please set the volume on your television sets
to maximum, and beckon everyone nearby...</i>

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.290
<i>...so they will see this broadcast.</i>

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:12.460
PRIME MINISTER
Attention all citizens.
As of seven o'clock this mornihg...

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:13.160
PRIME MINISTER

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.630
...a new prime minister has been...

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:25.180
Hi, all you maggots
in front of the television.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:29.710
I have been chosen to be your prime
minister. My name is Reiji Kageyama.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.680
NEW PRIME MINISTER REJI KAGEYAMIA
<i>Now then, I will take my
first matter of active official busirvess.</i>

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:39.650
<i>Starting today, you maggots have
all been placed under the management...</i>

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:43.180
<i>...of my government. To begin...</i>

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:48.390
...under the management of my invader
peacekeeping forces, I now declare martial law.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:53.160
Absurd! What of the freedom
of the common citizen?!

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:55.070
I'm through with him.
Take him away.

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:59.800
Listen, citizens! Listen, anybody!!
Save this country's future! Save this land!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.570
Release me!

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.450
Good work.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.430
Commander, go while you can!

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:25.830
Who is she?

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:28.460
Yes... This is the undercover
AEGIS agent we had on standby...

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:31.410
...in case of such an emergency:
Agent Ogawa!

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.340
Oh, intense!!

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:39.870
Now, we will use this opportunity
to make our escape!

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.680
Yes, sir!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:51.930
After revving up,
release the clutch slowly.

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.130
Got it!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:15.010
I'm so impressed I could cry!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.390
It worked!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:26.400
The engine works...

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:33.860
Dad's engine actually
made the gate robot work.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:37.210
We did it! We did it!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.710
Th- There's another odd one
here as well!

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:45.710
<i>Mr. Matsuda!</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.720
ls that Shun's voice?

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:52.220
Nice timing!
We really appreciate it!

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:54.910
Huh?

00:21:56.360 --> 00:22:01.390
<i>My government will strip
the citizens of all freedom.</i>

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:04.900
<i>Maggots do not need rights.
In addition...</i>

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:08.910
<i>...anyone who perpetrates a maggot like act
will be punished immediately by death!</i>

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.940
<i>Transgressors will be made
a contribution to population control.</i>

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:18.680
Also, effective immediately,
I will strip all of you of the right to daylight!

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:40.520
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:44.390
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:49.360
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:52.740
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:54.870
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:54.870 --> 00:23:00.040
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:03.380
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:08.010
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:12.880
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:17.520
